public class Main {static String plus(int n){String s="";for(int i=0;i<n;i++)s+="FIELD"+i+"|";return s;}static String builder(int n){StringBuilder b=new StringBuilder();for(int i=0;i<n;i++)b.append("FIELD").append(i).append('|');return b.toString();}static String buffer(int n){StringBuffer b=new StringBuffer();for(int i=0;i<n;i++)b.append("FIELD").append(i).append('|');return b.toString();}static void run(String name,java.util.function.IntFunction<String> f){long t=System.nanoTime();String s=f.apply(1000);System.out.println(name+" chars="+s.length()+" time(ns)="+(System.nanoTime()-t));}public static void main(String[]a){run("String +",Main::plus);run("StringBuilder",Main::builder);run("StringBuffer",Main::buffer);}}
